<title>UK: Moody's may downgrade Nikko Securities.</title>
<headline>Moody's may downgrade Nikko Securities.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investor Service said on Thursday it had placed the A3 senior debt rating of Nikko Securities Co., Ltd. under review for possible downgrade.</p>
<p>Moody's said in a statement the review would focus on the likely impact on Nikko's earnings and franchise of a deregulating domestic market, from which Nikko currently derived the majority of its revenues.</p>
<p>Moody's noted that Nikko's presence in non-Japanese securities markets is not particularly well developed at this time.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
